         RowBox[{"eng", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"purity0", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Re", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Tr", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "fac0", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
            "fac0"}], ")"}], " ", ".", " ", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "fac0", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
            "fac0"}], ")"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"recs", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"stateRecord", "[", 
          RowBox[{"t", ",", 
           RowBox[{"evolve", "[", 
            RowBox[{"t", ",", "eng"}], "]"}], ",", "eng", ",", "fac0", ",", 
           "rho0", ",", "purity0"}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"t", ",", "times"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
      RowBox[{"check", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
            RowBox[{"recs", ",", "\"\<TraceError\>\""}], "]"}], "]"}], "<", 
          "tol"}], " ", "&&", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Min", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", 
            RowBox[{"recs", ",", "\"\<MinEigenvalue\>\""}], "]"}], "]"}], ">=", 
          RowBox[{"-", "tol"}]}]}], 
        ",", "\"\<Reduced-state validation failed.\>\""}], "]"}], ";", "\n", 
      " ", "recs"}]}], "\n", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "Code",
 CellLabel->
  "In[157]:=",ExpressionUUID->"c4ffbffb-9abc-ef43-a805-cba71cd816ee"],

Cell["\<\
  This chapter uses only initialization definitions. It does not use a static \
scan, its parameters, or its eigenvectors. The initial state may be an \
edge/bulk product or any valid full-chain vector/density matrix, including a \
correlated state. Sector projections are computed before ED. The complex \
amplitudes between occupied sectors are retained in the full evolving factor; \
sector projection is not a dephasing operation.  \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7645f05c-ba2f-a84c-a263-aa60a4715220"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["  2.2 Independent model and time parameters  ", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"7a06f3ab-3fc7-4945-a568-bff8e062b368"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"dynModel", "=", 
   RowBox[{"<|", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\"\<L\>\"", "->", "8"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<J\>\"", "->", "1"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<Delta\>\"", "->", "0.01"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<g\>\"", "->", "0.1"}]}], "|>"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"dynTime", "=", 
   RowBox[{"<|", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\"\<Grid\>\"", "->", "\"\<Linear\>\""}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<tMax\>\"", "->", "1000."}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<dt\>\"", "->", "0.1"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<tMinPositive\>\"", "->", "0.01"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<LogPoints\>\"", "->", "201"}]}], "|>"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"dynSettings", "=", 
   RowBox[{"<|", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\"\<EDTolerance\>\"", "->", 
      RowBox[{"10", "^", 
       RowBox[{"-", "10"}]}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<ValidationTolerance\>\"", "->", 
      RowBox[{"10", "^", 
       RowBox[{"-", "8"}]}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<ProjectionCutoff\>\"", "->", "0"}]}], "|>"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"dynLogHorizontalAxis", "=", "False"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"dynOutputRoot", "=", 
   RowBox[{"resultRoot", "[", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"dynRunLabel", "=", "\"\<Exchange_state_dynamics\>\""}], 
  ";"}]}], "Code",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  4.001460743680977*^9, {4.001460800510315*^9, 4.0014608011148014`*^9}, {
