Cell["\<\
  The helix is a freely chosen initial product state. No matched boundary \
field or rigid-rotation protocol is added. Bulk alternatives are Polarized \
(Bit), InfiniteT, Gibbs (Beta), Typical (Beta, Samples, Seed), and User \
(State). Gibbs/Typical use only the field-free L-2-site bulk Hamiltonian.  \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f1e75685-8e52-4444-aea0-aa1b2d3f2c00"]
}, Open  ]],

